4 guests for non private tours.\n\n\n##Dolphin Sightings Guaranteed\nWe guarantee dolphin sightseeing during this tour or your will get you money back. Dolphins are non-migratory which means they are in the area year-round and our captains are very familiar with where to find them.\n\n## Departure Location\nWe depart from the Goodland Boat Park, located at 750 Palm Point Dr, Goodland, FL 34140, 10 minutes away from Marco Island. Goodland Boat Park is a beautiful water access point that  includes a 5.22 acre park, restrooms, concessions for sale from sunscreen to food and allows easy access to the Ten Thousand Islands and Gulf of Mexico.\n\n##Customizable\nOur Marco Island Dolphin tours are designed to accommodate everyone from individuals to groups of up to 14 people. Meet fellow adventurers and dolphin lovers or schedule a private boat tour for your group. We welcome individuals wanting to adventure on their own as well as large groups.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "Goodland Boat Park", "booking_notes": "![Thank you for booking](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/hSNNfNQTWC2K2MP2lAZe)\n[![CLICK HERE FOR DIRECTIONS](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/ggr7BmDWRneMAwYCoEPO)](https://www.google.com/maps/dir/25.955731,-81.7238755/GOODLAND+BOATING+PARK/@25.9391063,-81.7682825,12z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m9!4m8!1m1!4e1!1m5!1m1!1s0x88daf10a7e5f5a7b:0xd9efbd83fb662eaa!2m2!1d-81.6464898!2d25.9217576?entry=ttu)", "cancellation_notes": "Customers will receive a full refund if they cancel their reservation 48 hours prior to the date and time of their booking, (customers will be charged in full within the 48 hour period before the booking). Changes on your reservation will be received 48 hours in advance, otherwise your will be charged in full for your original booking. Contact us by phone to cancel or inquire about a cancellation. No-shows will be charged the full price. Customers will also receive a full refund in case of operator 